    ak:description "Is your organization committed to regularly repeating risk assessments for its most capable models to account for progress in post-deployment model enhancements (e.g., scaffolding programs, tool use, prompt engineering)? If yes, please comment on the frequency and scope of these repeated model-specific risk assessments." ;
