        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Physical security controls"@en ;
    ak:description "Please indicate whether your organization implements the following physical security controls. Please specify further whether they are implemented at all staff locations or more sparsely - Offices guarded by physical security teams - Comprehensive access logging for premises - Office entrances monitored by security cameras - Office access controlled via key cards implementing least access priviledge" ;
