        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Require security clearances and have private investigators conduct security checks"@en ;
    ak:description "Does your organization defend against insider threats by requiring security clearances or by having private investigators conduct background checks? Please select which interventions are applied when hiring or appointing individuals for the groups listed below. - Members of the board of directors - All staff with access to model weights - Certain key employees - All Staff" ;
